 </profile>
 </profiles>
 <rules><rule id="d8b534a7-2e1c-5da8-8931-14b70a55d8ba" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="ddd43773-12ec-50c6-9609-3a50a8ba4c23" name="Line" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="1647c6fa-147c-5d08-a6dc-76207ed68af5" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="ad5f3a74-11cb-555e-a4b1-2d94b674593f" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="01ddb81f-eec9-50a7-8b6f-2b57e240584e" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="9177d4d1-589c-5442-a6de-6429e8ed02ea" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="ce60522b-dace-5ff1-862c-5dec26990348" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="374833d5-bd54-5662-89a2-bf4713f61eba" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="11912c26-1be4-5a1e-bf9c-4ab2b19ff3ff" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="762cdc60-fbbd-5d07-8b72-75feb3cb5bb8" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="c28f648a-5cbf-537d-bcdd-7888f66c65b4" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="0693941c-2fb6-5e31-a35b-096d89351ab3" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="ddf5f009-5ee5-5cd1-a9fc-0510826f6cf2" name="Line" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup name="Prow Mounts" id="30e08e9a-605e-5cd4-9096-acfa94d57a23" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="ed186892-97ee-5f06-a829-8a966746edf2" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="849c41e4-c4a4-5968-8258-fd5186be4b62" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="b9d29abe-6cdf-5d48-ae4e-078821e00590" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="d210b223-8586-5545-bfd3-ebf05859ce94" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One torpedo per tube. Bypasses Void Shields; Armourbane within 6″; Reload (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="9de4eda3-5c45-5c06-98fb-c373ec4033d6" name="Power Spur" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="9188930b-7bbf-5e4e-af1f-7d8902b7c5ec" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="85824ba8-f56e-5561-985d-bee29fd0f693" name="Power Spur" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">Prow AV</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">—</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">—</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Ram weapon — resolved as part of a Ram, at Strength equal to this ship's Prow Armour Value. Devastating (3); Armourbane.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="50.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Dorsal Mounts" id="4cd755d3-8794-5a24-9958-f86873e44269" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="33d18cba-4432-577d-abe9-2f82ab11fd5b" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dee4ee7d-8f17-5d1c-8d22-d3d9d3ee12ee" name="Lance Turret" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="90dcee51-16fb-5b90-b1cf-d621b807a9d2" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="48d2de5a-1911-5ed5-816c-89ed3ed8d8d2" name="Lance Turret" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Dorsal</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">10</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">46″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Gets Hot; Reload (1); Devastating (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="13263bb6-50c5-5422-974c-f95b5c3e687e" name="Twin Lance Turret" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="3cc971c1-33c7-5df9-bcde-9c19f075afe1" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="7ced3b1f-f538-5998-8030-ff30a2a80241" name="Twin Lance Turret" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Dorsal</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">10</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">46″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Twin-Linked; Gets Hot; Reload (2); Devastating (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="15.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Port Mounts" id="5422be98-0b3e-5a3c-8acb-f4c950746ecc" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="237625cd-6c33-5bdb-96ce-1cd33cab7ec9" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="f3239fa3-44b6-5232-95fc-205b04ad49d2" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="355adef5-73a8-5242-8312-647cf2bc667a" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="87d1a9a2-a7c9-5392-a6d2-5df5047de331" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Port</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">8</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">30″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ce55caa7-a670-5e52-b97f-de47941e93ee" name="Heavy Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">