 <profile id="1a995523-8229-5e18-be52-351c0568fe19" name="Assault Ramp" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">In a Hull Assault may commit up to full current Crew, always keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="da3a8b55-8e1b-539f-a8a3-37e49badcbeb" name="Astartes Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Every Crew point aboard counts as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; eligible for Astartes boarding upgrades.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 </profiles>
 <rules><rule id="f85c0535-a251-5b67-9aa3-4dd44b2897a0" name="Line" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="7b6451f6-0e01-55e6-85c3-80be3f9fee5e" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="4cdcc8c1-d682-549a-8376-2dd34327a438" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="50ed6ca4-6545-5698-a08c-12967e547b57" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="1a5455a9-e4da-5640-a776-c65474476792" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="e20443ab-911a-53bf-80e1-3889ac7721b3" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="5e1592a1-4fda-5b7f-8217-e3d4aef51268" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="9af115ed-0066-55c2-8103-9a6be3cee88e" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="98a9e928-e211-592e-b9a7-42076ca825d5" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="211732a9-b91b-5aed-a9e3-ab57aab24e49" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="eba07354-82a2-5cd5-acd7-bae8b9ea53ee" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="75d237e2-fc86-5c64-9bbe-1145d5673367" name="Line" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
